{"id":"d42acaaa07bd3c4a","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-ample-excess.md","title":"Ample Excess 引理","display":"thm-ample-excess — Ample Excess 引理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-ample-excess","aliases":["43-thm-ample-excess"],"display":"thm-ample-excess — Ample Excess 引理","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.4 Theorem 9.4.1，印刷182–183，PDF202–203","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-ample-excess"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-ample-excess</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ample-excess — Ample Excess 引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.4 Theorem 9.4.1，印刷182–183，PDF202–203"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 为固定最优前缀复杂度（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}2^{n-K(X\\upharpoonright n)}&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}2^{n-K(X\\upharpoonright n)}&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>比逐项有界亏损更强的总和刻画。源书通过前缀复杂度的Kraft和与Markov估计构造检验。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.4 Theorem 9.4.1，印刷182–183，PDF202–203。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$K$ 为固定最优前缀复杂度（see [[43-df-prefixkolm]]）；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $X\\in2^\\omega$，$K$ 为固定最优前缀复杂度（see [[43-df-prefixkolm]]）；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\iff\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}2^{n-K(X\\upharpoonright n)}<\\infty.","display":true}],"bytes":1060,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-ample-excess]] — Ample Excess 引理"},{"id":"131ee254ab59ba2b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","6cd902d852c2c848"]}